<title>DENMARK: Landwirtschaftliche issues 260 mln DKK 4 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Landwirtschaftliche issues 260 mln DKK 4 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new issue was announced on Monday by German borrower Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank.</p>
<p> AMOUNT - 260 MLN DKK	MATURITY - SEVEN YEARS (date not</p>
<p>supplied)  COUPON - FOUR PERCENT  - THE ISSUE IS TO BE LISTED ON THE COPENHAGEN STOCK EXCHANGE ON DECEMBER 5, 1996.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
